geometry_msgs/Pose[] waypoints 
float32 average_speed 0.3 # speed between waypoints
float32 waypoint_speed 0.05 # speed at the waypoints
float64[] durations # is overloaded with average speed, if both are given, durations will be considered
# it must have the same dimension as waypoints
# the robot will be there at waypoint[i] at sum(duration[j], till i)
# if duration exceeds robot speed above maximum allowable speed, then it a different duration will be chosed
---
trajectory_msgs/JointTrajectory trajectory
bool success
int32 fraction 0# percentage
string message